# DentOrd — source of truth

- Product: **DentOrd** (`dentord.com`, multi-tenant dental SaaS). Avicena is UX/pattern reference only (D1).
- Before implementing features, read:
  - `docs/PRD-OrdinacijaOS.md` (requirements + Decision Log D1–D51)
  - `docs/Tech-OrdinacijaOS.md` when it exists
  - `docs/DB-OrdinacijaOS.md` when it exists
- Do **not** invent product requirements outside the PRD / Decision Log.
- Do **not** ship out-of-scope MVP items (AI, SMS/WhatsApp, patient portal, online booking) unless the PRD says otherwise.
- Entitlements come from `plans` / features — never hardcode plan gates only in UI (D42).
- Default locale BS, secondary EN (D37). Currency display EUR with VAT (PRD).
- Defaults: timezone `Europe/Sarajevo`, phone `+387` (D46–D47).
- Brand constants / emails: `lib/brand/constants.ts`; logo drop folder: `brand/`.
